{# India Double HRP weekly email.

Inherits the math-aware Stage 1 + Sticky + Stage 2 sections from
``double_hrp_email_base.html.j2`` so US and India read identically.
India does not trade through a paper account, so:

* No order-execution block (the parent default block hides it when
  ``order_results`` is None).
* No skipped notice (India never sets ``skipped`` -- there is no
  open-orders gate for paper-only).
* Footer trading note swapped for "Paper-only, no broker | NSE India". #}
{% extends "double_hrp_email_base.html.j2" %}

{% block document_title %}India Double HRP Portfolio Analysis{% endblock %}

{# Override palette to a teal/cyan family so US and India read
   distinctly in the inbox. The Stage 2 + sticky palette stays the
   default (green/cyan) since those are not strategy-distinguishing. #}
{% block strategy_primary %}#0d9488{% endblock %}
{% block strategy_primary_bg %}#f0fdfa{% endblock %}
{% block strategy_header_bg %}#ccfbf1{% endblock %}
{% block summary_grad_start %}#0d9488{% endblock %}
{% block summary_grad_end %}#0f766e{% endblock %}

{% block header %}
  <h1 style="color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 8px;">India Double HRP Portfolio Analysis (NSE)</h1>
  <div style="background-color: {{ self.strategy_header_bg() }}; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px; border-left: 4px solid {{ self.strategy_primary() }};">
    <strong>Target Week:</strong> {{ target_week_start }} &rarr; {{ target_week_end }} &nbsp;|&nbsp;
    <strong>As-of Date:</strong> {{ as_of_date }} &nbsp;|&nbsp;
    <strong>Universe:</strong> {{ universe }} &nbsp;|&nbsp;
    <strong>Strategy:</strong> Two-stage HRP + weight-band sticky (screen {{ stage1.symbols_used }} &rarr; top {{ top_n }})
  </div>
{% endblock %}

{% block footer_signature %}Generated by LearnFinance-2025 | Double HRP (Two-Stage Risk Parity) + Weight-band Sticky Selection | NSE India{% endblock %}

{% block footer_trading_note %}Paper-only, no broker{% endblock %}
